cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the OAL reference model when discussing or adapting its rules."
title: "OAL: Open Analysis Layers — Stable-v1.0.0"
type: software
version: Stable-v1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Alkimim
    given-names: Douglas de Oliveira
  - family-names: Chevitarese
    given-names: Bruno
abstract: >-
  A reference model in which each layer defines a metamodel and reusable
  models are instantiated by project artifacts. It connects use-case
  specification (UCS, L1), modeling and verification (ADMV, L2, combining
  ADPM and ADVS), implementation (ADI, L3), and interaction boundaries
  (ADIB, L4) through accountable derivations, engine metamodels with
  separated construction and execution, and traceable case-to-interface
  mappings.
keywords:
  - use cases
  - requirements engineering
  - verification
  - software architecture
  - traceability
